# Per-machine secrets and overrides (keys only here). Copy to .env (ignored) or symlink .env to a
# mode-600 file outside the repo. KEY=value per line; a variable already set in the environment wins.
# Layers for ./hw.sh: environment > .env > config/profiles/<profile>/ (merged over its `extends:` parents).

# This machine's config/profiles/<name> (--profile wins); empty = the one profile naming a network env.
ASTRO_PROFILE=
# Device logins and jump hosts: the keys the profile's YAMLs name under credentials:/jump:, listed
# keys-only in config/profiles/<profile>/secrets.env.example.
